OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mix of sunny spells and
OL,6,Fcloudy periods throughout the day but
OL,7,Fstaying dry. Feeling cool, with a
OL,8,Fbrisk easterly wind, particularly
OL,9,Falong the coast where it will be
OL,10,Fstronger.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FGenerally cloudy but dry
OL,13,Fovernight with a strong easterly wind
OL,14,Fnear the coast. Becoming cold through
OL,15,Fthe night with a frost possible by
OL,16,Fdawn over higher ground.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FRather cloudy but dry
OL,19,Fthrough Thursday. Perhaps a few
OL,20,Fbrighter spells during the afternoon.
OL,21,FTurning cold and frosty overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
